<title>LATVIA: ZEMES BANK PROFIT IN APRIL 75,000 LATS.</title>
<headline>ZEMES BANK PROFIT IN APRIL 75,000 LATS.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zemes Bank, Latvia's 8th largest bank in terms of assets, said on Tuesday that its after-tax profit in April was 75,000 lats.</p>
<p>It earlier reported that its first quarter profit was 411,000 lats.</p>
<p>The bank said in a statement that its own capital grew to 7.22 million lats from 7.14 million lats at the end of March while its balance sheet total rose to 46.65 million lats from 46.07 million lats.</p>
<p>Zemes deposits decreased to 25.06 million lats from 25.87 million lats in April, the bank said.</p>
<p>-- Martinsh Gravitis, Riga Newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
